  "provenance": "All six arms measure 4ab1bca0, the #840 firmware and identity on dev 604899c0: on a PHY reporting 1000BASE-T full duplex ability the PHY init advertises that mode only and restarts auto-negotiation once, the MDIO bit routine is inlined into both frame loops, and the configs carry the locally administered station MACs 02:4B:4C:4B:4C:01 and 02:4B:4C:4B:4C:02. The capture harness addresses its controller traffic to the configured station MAC and its MAC-derived entity_id. nvm_capture() and the census are unchanged, and so is the RTL. Processor pins a9e84b66 (protocol) and 135afd04 (gPTP). 67 of 96 captures repeat the previous receipt's system-cycle counts (d62417f1). The capture SoC has no Milan MAC MDIO CSR, so the PHY path is compiled out. ARM through ATTEST contains no heartbeat or PHY call.",
